## Entry-Level Grading

For each entry (experience or project), produce:

```
Entry: {name}
Hook Grade: {A/B/C/D/F}
Keep: {Yes / Yes but deprioritize / Replace / Cut}
Hook Assessment: {1 sentence from the hiring manager's perspective — what you thought reading the first bullet}
Weakest Bullet: {quote it} → {what's wrong with it}
Strongest Bullet: {quote it} → {why it works}
Role Fit: {how relevant this entry is to THIS specific role — not generically}
```

